        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 1152, height: 92, background: '#F4F7FA', borderRadius: 8, padding: '0 20px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 56, background: '#20344B' }} />
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 3 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>两者配合，不互相替代</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#546779' }}>业务函数可以先被 Python 直接调用，再由 MCP 服务暴露；两条路径复用同一份业务校验代码。</Text>
